1
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:01,720
Sir,

2
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:02,880
the fish has taken the bait.

3
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:04,200
Aren't you going to reel it in?

4
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,280
No rush.

5
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:06,700
Bait the spot well,

6
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,200
so none of them can escape.

7
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:15,640
Sir, brilliant.

8
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:17,800
Sir,

9
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:19,320
Regarding this matter,

10
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:20,320
I made a mistake.

11
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:22,280
I shouldn't have saved her.

12
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:24,480
Did it hinder your grand plan?

13
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:27,240
Use the right bait for the right fish.

14
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:29,400
I used a few centipedes as bait

15
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,880
specifically to catch poisonous fish.

16
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:35,039
Fight poison with poison. Sir, brilliant.

17
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:45,700
Many years ago,

18
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:48,020
my father died a tragic death.

19
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:49,440
Before he died,

20
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:51,700
I didn't even get to see him one last time.

21
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:54,720
I know exactly how you feel.

22
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:56,680
I believe

23
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,940
if they are watching over you,

24
00:01:59,479 --> 00:02:01,280
they will definitely guide you.

25
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:03,720
What if he isn't?

26
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,720
If it were me,

27
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,400
I would leave no stone unturned

28
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,600
to find them.

29
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:11,400
The truth

30
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,640
will always come to light.

31
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:20,520
Lin Jinwen.

32
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:21,520
No.

33
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:24,200
I should call you Lin Yousheng.

34
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:27,240
If even your name is a lie,

35
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:30,260
every feeling you have for me,

36
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:32,360
and everything you've done,

37
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:33,800
what is actually real?

38
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:36,000
Lin Yousheng.

39
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,120
Can you tell me,

40
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:40,960
who exactly are you?

41
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:42,960
Boss.

42
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:45,120
Sorry to bother you again.

43
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:45,720
This time,

44
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:46,800
I want you to look through these

45
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,040
and see if anyone looks familiar.

46
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:50,040
Boss, take a look. Is it this person?

47
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:54,640
No.

48
00:02:55,079 --> 00:02:55,800
He's younger than him.

49
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:56,930
What about this one?

50
00:02:58,480 --> 00:02:59,440
Not him either.

51
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:02,320
Boss.

52
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,810
Please go through all of these.

53
00:03:10,440 --> 00:03:12,320
Qian Yanqing's interrogation record.

54
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,720
Let's take a closer look.

55
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,640
Lin Yousheng, male, 15 years old.

56
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:30,880
Please give me some food.

57
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,200
Please give me some food.

58
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,720
Have mercy.

59
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:37,200
Have mercy.

60
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:04,640
The embroidery shop owner said

61
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:05,680
this person was wearing

62
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:07,600
what only our police officers wear,

63
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:09,560
the standard-issue Meihua leather shoes.

64
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:11,080
Even though we have screened everyone in the Fenghuang Police Station

65
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,240
one by one,

66
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,360
I am sure

67
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:15,320
this Master is a police officer.

68
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:16,880
Not necessarily.

69
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:17,920
What if...

70
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:20,360
He's intentionally misleading us.

71
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:23,020
Then let's check one by one to see who lost a shoe.

72
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:25,640
Although it's troublesome to investigate,

73
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:27,640
it's the only clue we have right now.

74
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,200
I agree with Shi'an.

75
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:33,000
Investigating all the police officers

76
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,300
is simply impossible.

77
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:35,480
Why is it impossible,

78
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,280
Senior?

79
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:38,530
Why don't we give it a try first?

80
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,530
I said no, and that means no.

81
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:04,100
Hello, Father.

82
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:05,480
Hello.

83
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:07,520
I'm a bit curious.

84
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:09,640
About what?

85
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:11,080
In this photo,

86
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,760
is this person also a priest?

87
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:13,440
Yes.

88
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:15,010
His name is Father John.

89
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:17,920
Then why does he have a snake tattooed on his chest?

90
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,800
Isn't a snake a symbol of evil?

91
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:21,440
This means

92
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:23,040
using the power of God

93
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,160
to suppress evil.

94
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:27,360
Do many priests get this tattoo?

95
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,040
Not necessarily.

96
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:29,600
He

97
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:31,730
has already gone to heaven.

98
00:05:32,159 --> 00:05:32,800
Father,

99
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:34,159
I meant no offense.

100
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:36,360
I just think he passed away too early.

101
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:37,440
It's a bit of a pity.

102
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:38,880
His name was John.

103
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:41,840
He used to be the best priest here.

104
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:44,760
He was a kind and loving person.

105
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:46,780
Over ten years ago,

106
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:48,680
he and I came to China together.

107
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:51,760
Later, he was killed by a child.

108
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:56,040
Father John was so good to them.

109
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:58,440
How could he be killed by a child?

110
00:05:58,640 --> 00:06:00,080
Because this child

111
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:02,240
was tempted by the devil of greed

112
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,100
and bewitched.

113
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:05,040
Not only did he kill John,

114
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:07,960
but he also stole all his belongings.

115
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:19,920
Why are you following me?

116
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:21,450
Stop investigating alone.

117
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:22,600
I'll help you.

118
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,120
Just do your job.

119
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:26,080
I know you're looking into

120
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:28,480
Lin Yousheng's case from over a decade ago.

121
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:31,880
Lin Yousheng was the orphan

122
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:34,080
adopted by the Anglican Church back then.

123
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:35,340
He killed Father John.

124
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,240
But this case has many suspicious points.

125
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,480
Over a decade ago,

126
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:41,080
Lin Yousheng killed Father John.

127
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:43,960
But the police classified it as robbery and murder.

128
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:45,600
Lin Yousheng didn't steal any money.

129
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,320
You suspect

130
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:48,240
Lin Yousheng is still alive.

131
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:50,600
Ye Shi'an,

132
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,320
you've crossed the line.

133
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:53,810
Mind your own business.

134
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:56,080
I'll take you to see someone.

135
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:57,240
It might help you.

136
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,080
Who?

137
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:02,250
Why are you here?

138
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:03,490
Hello, Mr. Song.

139
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:04,520
Please.

140
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:07,500
Please have a seat.

141
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:14,600
Mr. Song,

142
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,200
let me introduce you.

143
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:18,800
This is Jiang Siyao,

144
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,440
Detective Jiang from the Phoenix Police Department.

145
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:20,840
Hello.

146
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:21,680
Hello.

147
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:23,200
This is Song Yingwu,

148
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:24,800
the former detective of the Concession Police Station,

149
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:25,730
Detective Song.

150
00:07:26,080 --> 00:07:27,080
He was in charge of

151
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,560
Lin Yousheng's case.

152
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:29,800
Sir,

153
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:31,840
we'd like to ask you about

154
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:33,120
the murder case of Lin Yousheng

155
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,640
at the Anglican Church.

156
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,760
The details of the case

157
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,640
are all in the file.

158
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:40,610
What's there to talk about?

159
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:42,360
Sir,

160
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:43,760
I heard from Bai Weng

161
00:07:43,760 --> 00:07:45,820
that you love this hazel grouse soup.

162
00:07:47,280 --> 00:07:49,540
Bai Weng taught me how to make it himself.

163
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,480
Please try it.

164
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,720
That old guy

165
00:07:53,159 --> 00:07:54,240
really knows me.

166
00:07:57,159 --> 00:07:58,080
Smells good.

167
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:00,960
Sir,

168
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:03,240
we'd like to know

169
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:04,280
why that case

170
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:06,330
wasn't investigated further.

171
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,880
I don't know.

172
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:11,120
You handled that case yourself.

173
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,720
How could you not know?

174
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:14,690
Detective Song,

175
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:16,020
I've heard your story.

176
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:18,880
When the foreigners at Jardine Matheson

177
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:21,160
forcibly occupied the land of Dongxing Village,

178
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:23,040
you withstood the pressure from your superiors,

179
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:24,120
defied the powerful,

180
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,880
and sought justice for the villagers,

181
00:08:25,880 --> 00:08:28,010
almost getting assassinated by them.

182
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,360
I know

183
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:31,360
you are among the first graduates of the police academy

184
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:32,640
and my senior.

185
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,780
Don't you have any regrets

186
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:36,240
about this case?

187
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,320
Do you

188
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:39,280
really want to investigate?

189
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,039
I promise you,

190
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:43,440
I will investigate this case to the end.

191
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:44,560
For so many years,

192
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:45,920
that case

193
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:48,400
has always been my regret.

194
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:51,200
This John

195
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:53,240
took in many poor children,

196
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:56,440
but it was all to satisfy his own lust.

197
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:59,840
Lin Yousheng was also a victim.

198
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:03,020
He came to me to report the case back then.

199
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,690
I found out everything.

200
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,010
However,

201
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:08,480
the case was suppressed by higher-ups.

202
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:11,760
Lin Yousheng had nowhere to appeal,

203
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:13,800
and finally killed John,

204
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:15,400
becoming a wanted criminal.

205
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:18,600
I never saw him again.

206
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:21,240
That beast.

207
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:22,520
Mr. Song.

208
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,770
Have you seen this picture?

209
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,160
Back then,

210
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:32,680
I found this,

211
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,940
and everything came to an abrupt end.

212
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:46,400
Jiang Siyao, come out!

213
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:48,800
You killed my son!

214
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:51,600
My son!

215
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:55,400
Jiang Siyao, get out here!

216
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:58,720
People like this don't deserve to be police officers.

217
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,050
You ruthless murderer!

218
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:02,480
Tell Jiang Siyao to come out right now!

219
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,210
Don't go out.

220
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:05,140
Let me handle things outside.

221
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:06,800
I'll go explain it to them.

222
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:08,280
Let me do it. Trust me.

223
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:09,650
They are so pitiful.

224
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:27,240
Yesterday,

225
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,900
I heard an interesting story.

226
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:30,920
It just so happens that this story

227
00:10:30,920 --> 00:10:33,320
has to do with both Jiang Siyao and Ye Shian.

228
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,520
What is it?

229
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:35,960
A while ago,

230
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,280
Jiang Siyao and Ye Shian

231
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:39,560
came to the police station to find a senior officer

232
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:42,020
to investigate a case from over a decade ago.

233
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:42,920
What case?

234
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:45,480
They were probably investigating a suspect.

235
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:47,360
But I strongly suspect that this suspect

236
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:49,290
is closely related to Jiang Siyao.

237
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:50,040
And

238
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:52,600
it's also related to the Jingxiang Society case.

239
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:53,400
And then?

240
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,060
Do you remember

241
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:58,640
last time when we asked the boss of Furui Embroidery Shop

242
00:10:58,640 --> 00:11:01,080
to investigate every police officer in the Phoenix Police Station?

243
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:02,200
We actually missed one person.

244
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:02,840
Who?

245
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:06,160
Lin Jinwen, who just died in the line of duty.

246
00:11:06,160 --> 00:11:07,800
Jiang Siyao's fiancé.

247
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:10,080
I know you are also suspecting Lin Jinwen.

248
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:11,520
I investigated him before.

249
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:13,080
On the 15th of every month,

250
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:14,960
Lin Jinwen would inexplicably disappear.

251
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:18,290
And when Lin Jinwen had an accident on the 14th of last month,

252
00:11:18,400 --> 00:11:20,840
the master of the Jingxiang Society didn't go to preach.

253
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:22,920
I saw the photos of Lin Jinwen's body.

254
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:26,440
He happened to have three cigarette burns on his right arm.

255
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:28,920
He is the master that Boss Qian mentioned.

256
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:33,530
I received a letter yesterday.

257
00:11:34,880 --> 00:11:35,940
Inside the letter,

258
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,000
there was a photo.

259
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:40,700
You still remember Wei Xiaodong, right?

260
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:45,320
Wei Xiaodong.
